Factory Planner Packs — Third-Party Game Data & Assets Notice

1. Repository contents (text only):
   This Git repository contains converter scripts, GameData v4 templates,
   regression test cases, and machine-readable JSON production metadata
   (resource IDs, recipe ratios, machine parameters, and formulas) authored
   for Factory Planner. No raw game dumps or graphical icon assets are stored
   in Git.

2. Third-party trademarks and game assets:
   All game titles, item/fluid/machine names, logos, and any icon assets
   bundled into optional GitHub Release archives (`icons.pak`) are the
   property of their respective developers and publishers. Inclusion of a
   game pack does not imply endorsement by or affiliation with the original
   game creators.

3. Takedown / redistribution requests:
   Release archives redistribute resized game icons strictly for companion
   planning convenience. If you are a rights holder and would like icons
   removed from a release archive, please open an issue in this repository;
   Factory Planner supports every pack in "no icons" mode without icons.
